                <hr>
                <h2><strong>Profile</strong></h2>
                <p>Technology strategist and systems thinker with over three decades of experience designing durable digital platforms at the intersection of data, AI, and human-centered systems. I specialize in turning ambiguity into clear technical direction — building solutions that scale, endure organizational change, and remain understandable over time.</p>
                <p>My work spans geospatial platforms, large-scale data infrastructure, AI-driven products, and next-generation user experiences. I’m often brought in at pivotal moments to help teams and founders navigate complexity, align technology with intent, and move forward with confidence. I describe this approach as <strong>Quiet Tech</strong>: technology that empowers rather than overwhelms.</p>
